<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Proxima cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Proxima cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it downgraded Proxima Corp to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- said Proxima is seeing slowing demand across all product lines and will likely be behind in a transition to new products.</p>
<p>-- cut the fourth quarter earnings estimate to $0.05 a share from $0.32 a share.</p>
<p>-- Proxima lost 39/64 to 7-7/8 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
